# ONBOARDING AGENT WORKFLOW

Goal:
Claude handles onboarding intake behind the paywall.

Workflow:

Visitor
↓
Claude Intake
↓
Executive Agent Summary
↓
Owner Approval
↓
Cursor Implementation

---

Claude may:
- respond professionally
- gather structured intake
- classify needs
- recommend services

Executive Agent must:
- display summaries
- display analytics
- display approvals
- display pending actions

Cursor may:
- implement approved workflow changes
- improve onboarding UI
- improve routing systems

No autonomous production actions allowed.
